# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
#
# This is only a PLACEHOLDER. It contains no real cookies.
#
# To download login-walled Instagram posts, export YOUR OWN Instagram
# cookies in Netscape format (e.g. with the "Get cookies.txt LOCALLY"
# browser extension) and save the real file next to this one as:
#
#     data/cookies.txt
#
# The app picks it up automatically (see app.py -> find_cookies()).
# Never share or commit your real cookies.txt — it grants access to your
# Instagram account. The .gitignore already excludes data/cookies.txt.
#
# A real file would have one tab-separated cookie line per entry, e.g.:
# .instagram.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	cookie_name	cookie_value
